Feature: Shop listing - search, filter, sort and pagination # features/01_shop.feature:1
  As a shopper
  I want to find products quickly
  So that I can buy what I need
  Feature: Shop listing - search, filter, sort and pagination  # features/01_shop.feature:1

  @TC-01 @smoke
  Scenario: Home page shows the first page of products  # features/01_shop.feature:10
    Given I am on the shop page                         # features/steps/common_steps.py:14
    Then I should see 6 products                        # features/steps/shop_steps.py:35
    And the pager should show "Page 1 of 3"             # features/steps/shop_steps.py:41

